## Interface: 16001, 120105
## Title: Every Setting
## Notes: Every console variable (CVar) in WoW Forever and retail in one searchable window: view distance, ground clutter, camera distance, loot sparkles and HDR (Forever), with real ranges, undo, FPS before and after, and your values set again at every login.
